<title>UK: Sept Oseberg programme equiv 42.6 cargoes - trade.</title>
<headline>Sept Oseberg programme equiv 42.6 cargoes - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's Oseberg crude system will load the equivalent of 42.6 standard cargoes in September, up from the 38.6 expected in August, traders said.</p>
<p>Total volume should be 21.32 million barrels, up from 19.32 million in August, they said.</p>
<p>The programme consisted of one cargo of two million barrels, one of one million, one of 820,000 barrels, five loadings of 500,000 and 25 of 600,000, the sources added.</p>
<p>July loadings were 20.4 million, up from June's summer maintenance-hit 15.35 million barrels.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 8060</p>
